---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CopySnippet from '../../components/CopySnippet.astro';
import DomainProfiles from '../../components/DomainProfiles.astro';
import AgentLogo from '../../components/AgentLogo.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { docsSections } from '../../data/docs';
import { agentsByLang, omniSpecRelease } from '../../data/omnispec';
import { translations } from '../../i18n/translations';
const t=translations.es;
const title=(text:string)=>text.replace(/^\d+(?:\.\d+)?\.?\s+/,'');
const extra=[
 {id:'mantenimiento',es:'Actualizar una instalación',en:'Update an installation'},
 {id:'recuperacion',es:'Si algo no funciona',en:'If something goes wrong'}
];
const nav=docsSections.map(s=>({id:s.id,es:title(s.es.title),en:title(s.en.title)})).concat(extra);
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/,'');
---
<Layout title="Documentación — OmniSpec" titleEn="Documentation — OmniSpec" description="Guía de OmniSpec: instalación, primer cambio, archivos, integraciones y evidencia." descriptionEn="OmniSpec guide: installation, first change, files, integrations and evidence.">
<Navbar/>
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-heading docs-heading"><p class="eyebrow">OMNISPEC / {omniSpecRelease.version}</p><h1 data-i18n="docs.title">{t['docs.title']}</h1><p class="body-copy" data-i18n="docs.subtitle">{t['docs.subtitle']}</p></header>
  <div class="docs-layout">
    <aside class="docs-sidebar"><h2 data-i18n="docs.nav">{t['docs.nav']}</h2><nav aria-label={t['docs.nav']} data-i18n-aria="docs.nav">{nav.map(item=><a href={'#'+item.id}>{(['es','en'] as const).map(lang=><span data-locale={lang} hidden={lang==='en'}>{item[lang]}</span>)}</a>)}</nav></aside>
    <details class="docs-mobile-nav"><summary data-i18n="docs.nav">{t['docs.nav']}</summary><nav aria-label={t['docs.nav']} data-i18n-aria="docs.nav">{nav.map(item=><a href={'#'+item.id}>{(['es','en'] as const).map(lang=><span data-locale={lang} hidden={lang==='en'}>{item[lang]}</span>)}</a>)}</nav></details>
    <main id="main-content" class="prose" tabindex="-1">
      <div class="docs-shortcuts">
        {[['terminal','instalacion','Instalar','Install'],['file','estructura','Conocer los archivos','Understand the files'],['checklist','quality-gates','Revisar una entrega','Review a delivery']].map(([icon,id,es,en])=><a href={'#'+id}><Icon name={icon} size={25}/><span data-locale="es">{es}</span><span data-locale="en" hidden>{en}</span><Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a>)}
      </div>
      {docsSections.map(section=><section id={section.id}>
        {(['es','en'] as const).map(lang=><div data-locale={lang} hidden={lang==='en'}><h2>{title(section[lang].title)}</h2>{section[lang].paragraphs.map(p=><p set:html={p}/>)}</div>)}
        {section.commands.map(command=><CopySnippet command={command}/>)}
        {section.code && <pre tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={t['docs.code']} data-i18n-aria="docs.code"><code>{section.code}</code></pre>}
        {section.id==='perfiles-catalogo' && <DomainProfiles/>}
        {section.id==='adaptadores-agentes' && (['es','en'] as const).map(lang=><dl class="integration-list" data-locale={lang} hidden={lang==='en'}>{Object.entries(agentsByLang[lang]).map(([key,agent])=><div><dt><AgentLogo agent={key} size={23}/>{agent.title}</dt><dd>{agent.desc}</dd><dd><strong>{lang==='es'?'Inicio:':'Start:'}</strong> <code>{agent.invocation}</code></dd><dd><code>{agent.path}</code></dd></div>)}</dl>)}
      </section>)}
      <section id="mantenimiento">
        <div data-locale="es"><h2>Actualizar una instalación</h2><p>Ejecuta primero el diagnóstico desde la raíz del proyecto. Revisa la propuesta de actualización antes de aplicarla. <code>init</code> prepara una instalación; no migra otra versión.</p></div>
        <div data-locale="en" hidden><h2>Update an installation</h2><p>Run diagnostics from the project root first. Review the proposed update before applying it. <code>init</code> prepares an installation; it does not migrate another version.</p></div>
        <CopySnippet command="npx --yes omni-spec@preview doctor"/>
        <CopySnippet command="npx --yes omni-spec@preview update --dry-run"/>
        <div data-locale="es"><p>Si la propuesta corresponde a lo que buscas, ejecuta <code>npx --yes omni-spec@preview update</code>. Conserva una copia de tus cambios y revisa los conflictos que indique el CLI; no uses <code>--force</code> como solución automática.</p></div>
        <div data-locale="en" hidden><p>If the proposal matches your intent, run <code>npx --yes omni-spec@preview update</code>. Keep a copy of your changes and review conflicts reported by the CLI; do not use <code>--force</code> as an automatic fix.</p></div>
      </section>
      <section id="recuperacion">
        <div data-locale="es"><h2>Si algo no funciona</h2><ul class="recovery-list"><li><strong>La skill no aparece.</strong> Abre la raíz del proyecto, reinicia la herramienta y pide al agente que lea la ruta que imprimió el instalador. Consulta las <a href="#adaptadores-agentes">rutas de cada integración</a>.</li><li><strong>La instalación se interrumpió.</strong> Ejecuta <code>doctor</code> y revisa <code>update --dry-run</code>. Una salida con error puede dejar escritura parcial.</li><li><strong>Hay otra versión o instalación global.</strong> Comprueba qué CLI y qué instrucciones está leyendo el agente. El plugin global de Antigravity se gestiona por separado.</li><li><strong>Un check falla o expira.</strong> Lee el comando, la carpeta de trabajo y su salida. Corrige la causa y repite la verificación; un fallo no cuenta como evidencia de aprobación.</li><li><strong>No se puede copiar.</strong> Usa la acción «Seleccionar comando» y copia con el teclado. El contenido permanece visible para poder recuperarlo.</li></ul></div>
        <div data-locale="en" hidden><h2>If something goes wrong</h2><ul class="recovery-list"><li><strong>A skill is missing.</strong> Open the project root, restart your tool and ask the agent to read the path printed by the installer. See the <a href="#adaptadores-agentes">integration paths</a>.</li><li><strong>Installation was interrupted.</strong> Run <code>doctor</code> and review <code>update --dry-run</code>. An error exit may leave partially written files.</li><li><strong>Another version or global install exists.</strong> Check which CLI and instructions the agent reads. The global Antigravity plugin is managed separately.</li><li><strong>A check fails or times out.</strong> Read its command, working directory and output. Fix the cause and verify again; a failure is not approval evidence.</li><li><strong>Copy is unavailable.</strong> Use “Select command” and copy with your keyboard. The content remains visible for recovery.</li></ul></div>
      </section>
      <p class="docs-source"><a class="quiet-link" href="https://github.com/brahiandres1999-oss/omni-spec/tree/v0.7.0-preview.2/docs"><Icon name="book"/><span data-i18n="docs.source">{t['docs.source']}</span></a></p>
      <a class="quiet-link" href={base+'/changelog/'} data-i18n="nav.changelog">{t['nav.changelog']}</a>
    </main>
  </div>
</div>
<Footer/>
</Layout>
<script>
 const links=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.docs-sidebar a'));
 const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{
  const entry=entries.find(item=>item.isIntersecting);
  if(!entry)return;
  links.forEach(link=>{if(link.hash==='#'+entry.target.id)link.setAttribute('aria-current','location');else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');});
 },{rootMargin:'-100px 0px -65% 0px',threshold:0});
 document.querySelectorAll('.prose > section[id]').forEach(section=>observer.observe(section));
 const menu=document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('.docs-mobile-nav');
 menu?.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',()=>{menu.open=false;}));
 menu?.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{if(event.key==='Escape'){menu.open=false;menu.querySelector('summary')?.focus();}});
</script>
